{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "66", "x": 0.9036148555787364, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03012839302489931, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "WRITING TASK 2", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15332015586781156, "w": 0.2572297009049775, "h": 0.02614255646024867, "c": 1, "size": 18.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "You should spend about 40 minutes on this task.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1915736180503804, "w": 0.5004288362505271, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Write about the following topic:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21975564760916533, "w": 0.3308729651231637, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In many countries, primary and secondary schools close for two months or more", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2488276757028514, "w": 0.8069292617803479, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "in the summer holidays.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2771951436272197, "w": 0.24826135620213943, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "What is the value of long school holidays?", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.30537717318600466, "w": 0.4327335828585659, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "What are the arguments in favour of shorter school holidays?", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.333707504399446, "w": 0.6292839154853997, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Give reasons for your answer and include any relevant examples from your own", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.390961562051917, "w": 0.8260336335161456, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "knowledge or experience.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41929191212605466, "w": 0.2671761080358751, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Write at least 250 words.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.44762229992158475, "w": 0.2605242121393031, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Essay [ Candidate Essay]", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.47657071501201276, "w": 0.26499186515754036, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5049010650861504, "w": 0.7351093526031035, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "If we look at the pictures we will see how Beechwood Farm has changed along", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5332314528816805, "w": 0.8070065655955168, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the time.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5615618029558181, "w": 0.09417670565383085, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Years ago, in 1950, Beachwood Farm was a tipycal farm. A track crossed the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5898921907513482, "w": 0.8071317485641124, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "farm, so farmers could reach the barn and the farmhouse passing by the fruit", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6182225408254859, "w": 0.8067672723533362, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "trees, and the place where the soft fruits and the vegetables were growing. At", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6465529663424086, "w": 0.806898196719345, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the opposite side of the truck, was the field where the sheeps were situated.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6749203588239918, "w": 0.8074969424495652, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "That was close to the farmhouse, were chickens were also situated. All the farm", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7032507843409145, "w": 0.8070937118062508, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was sourrounded, at the south, by a river.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7315811344150521, "w": 0.42100934176621585, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Nowadeys, the farm has suffered changes. Modern life brought to the farm", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7599114844891898, "w": 0.8069414622498506, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "some needs to survive. The main change was the road that replaced the track.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7882419100061123, "w": 0.8073010172628442, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Now is easyer to arrive any place in the farm.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.81657226008025, "w": 0.4591065380880716, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There is a parking zone near the road where the sheeps used to eat grass. We", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8449026101543876, "w": 0.806593492556637, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "can also find a camping field and Solar panels in that zone.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8732577054620124, "w": 0.5998543325456341, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Another parking zone can be find where the solar panels are situated.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.90158805553615, "w": 0.7093080765160135, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}